{"Title":"An Act relative to the Gardner District Court","BillNumber":"S984","DocketNumber":"SD38","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T12:25:07.737"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AMG0","Name":"Anne M. Gobi","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMG0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T12:25:07.7366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S984/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Ms. Gobi, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 984) of Anne M. Gobi for legislation relative to the Gardner District Court.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1 of Chapter 218 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 308 through 309, the words \"The district court at Winchendon, held at Winchendon; Winchendon, Ashburnham, Phillipston, Royalston and Templeton.\"\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 1 of 218 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 282 through 283, the words \"Gardner, Petersham, Hubbardston and Westminster\" and inserting after the word \"Gardner;\" the following words:-\r\n\tAshburnham, Gardner, Hubbardston, Petersham, Phillipston, Royalston, Templeton and Westminster.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}